.el .ds Aq '
.TH tapectl-key-rotate 1  "tapectl-key-rotate " 
.SH NAME
tapectl\-key\-rotate \- Rotate keys for a tenant (deactivate old, generate new). Refuses unless a permanent escrow recipient is registered (ADR\-0005); never deactivates or replaces the escrow key itself
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtapectl key rotate\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] <\fB\-\-tenant\fR> [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rotate keys for a tenant (deactivate old, generate new). Refuses unless a permanent escrow recipient is registered (ADR\-0005); never deactivates or replaces the escrow key itself
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-\-tenant\fR \fI<TENANT>\fR
Tenant name
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would be done without making changes
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose output
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
